// Single atlas 3D texture that stores all 7 SH sub-volumes stacked along Z.
// Atlas depth = 7 * ( nz + 2 ) where nz = probesResolution.z.
// Each sub-volume occupies ( nz + 2 ) slices: 1 padding + nz data + 1 padding.
